// Host is the closed set of RPCs the server may call on an agent host over the reverse tunnel. It has
// no verb that runs code, writes a file, deletes, changes a service or registry value, or updates
// outside the signed channel (TM-D13); fitness-proto AG1 to AG8 pin that list. Every RPC is unary.
